{"id":"incense-bark","name":{"en":"Incense Bark","ja":"薫木の皮"},"desc":{"en":"This is the bark of an incense tree. The fragrance changes depending on the tree. It can be used as a spice or for aromatic items.","ja":"香木の表面の皮を剥ぎ取ったもの。採る木に よって香りが異なり、香辛料やアロマの材料 などになる。木の方は表面の皮だけなので、 数週間もすれば元通り再生する。"},"level":6,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-west-ruins","name":{"en":"Alanya West Ruins","ja":"アランヤ西部遺跡地帯"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"grune-rainforest","name":{"en":"Grune Rainforest","ja":"グリューネ雨林"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"spice","name":{"en":"(Spice)","ja":"（香料）"},"icon":"totori-category-spice"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":9}